{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"281347da42882583328297a080f3e033dd2f09c2afd5e7c1f515ad92f8fcc8b0"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:7d5585d5717c6ee9ae7e6ef38db831d976b0a1246a76e978b89aca3a7474f1b6","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"From her travels in Europe","evidence":"[D8:15 | 6:03 pm on 6 March, 2023] Maria: Thanks, John! I got the idea from that trip to England a few years ago - I was mesmerized by the castles. I wanted to bring that same magic to my home, like a reminder of the world's beauty. I made a painting too!","itemId":"urn:uuid:ccea20cd-6eea-5ab1-b6ae-fbd706a294a8","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:ee42d2994df1f04067ef8a17cb5aa04647c41c57be30d757a8015577e299a97d","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Where did Maria get the idea for the castle shadow box in her home?","referenceAnswer":"England","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"ee42d2994df1f04067ef8a17cb5aa04647c41c57be30d757a8015577e299a97d"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}